# Angel of Vitality ("you gain that much life plus 1 instead") and Boon Reflection ("you gain twice that much life
# instead") both apply to Lightning Helix's 3 life. Bot1, whose life it is, chooses the order (CR 616.1): the Angel
# first, so 3 becomes 4, and Boon Reflection then doubles it to 8 (20 -> 28). The other order makes 7
# (boon-reflection-applied-before-angel-of-vitality-gains-seven-from-three). At 25 or more life the Angel is a 4/4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Sol Ring
Mox Pearl
Angel of Vitality
Plains
Boon Reflection
Mountain
Lightning Helix
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

